Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.38,0:00:06.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder if that man, Hiraku Machio,\Nhas been doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.79,0:00:10.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Having wondered how he was faring,\NI decided to observe him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.33,0:00:12.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I am God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.83,0:00:16.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The salvation of souls is part of my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:19.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However, even God makes mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.29,0:00:26.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mistakenly bestowed a life of suffering\Nfit for a sinner upon an innocent man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:30.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Interfering after someone has\Nstarted their life is against the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.79,0:00:32.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In an attempt to make up for what I'd done,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.96,0:00:36.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I gave him a chance at a second life\Nper his wishes, however...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.29,0:00:42.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Isn't this forest in a dangerous area\Nfilled with wicked nasty monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.46,0:00:44.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure it's called The Forest of Death...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:48.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He was thrown in there all alone\Nand told to sustain himself by farming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.46,0:00:50.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What kind of twisted game is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.13,0:00:52.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need to call him back right away... but no!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:55.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just said that would be\Nan infraction of the rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.63,0:00:59.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's a chance he'll find his way\Nback here again as a soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.50,0:01:01.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If that happens, I hope he accepts my apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.75,0:01:04.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even God... makes mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.83,0:02:39.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here are the results from me having used\Nthe almighty farming tool for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.46,0:02:41.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've been able to learn several things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.13,0:02:45.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,First, there are the crops that I was able\Nto grow without planting any seeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.83,0:02:47.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There are potatoes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.58,0:02:48.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,onions,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:50.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,tomatoes, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.58,0:02:52.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,cabbage as well as others.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.08,0:02:57.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,These are the exact plants I was thinking about\Nwhile I was tilling the land earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.88,0:02:58.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I imagine the plants I want to grow\Nwhile I'm using the almighty farming tool,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.33,0:03:00.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Eggplant! Eggplant! Eggplant! Eggplant!\N{\rSubtitle}If I imagine the plants I want to grow{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}while I'm using the almighty farming tool,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.79,0:03:01.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I imagine the plants I want to grow\Nwhile I'm using the almighty farming tool,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.38,0:03:03.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,those seeds become sowed in the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.46,0:03:05.00,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I... want... spinach!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:05.54,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I... want... spinach!\N{\rSubtitle}When I looked for proof so that{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}I could put this theory to the test...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.54,0:03:08.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When I looked for proof so that\NI could put this theory to the test...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.08,0:03:09.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,here's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.21,0:03:12.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wanted something that I'd be able to identify\Nas soon as it sprouted,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.58,0:03:16.88,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Bean sprouts! Bean sprouts! Bean sprouts!\N{\rSubtitle}so I thought about how much{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}I wanted soybeans while I was tilling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.88,0:03:18.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Bean sprouts!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.54,0:03:21.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And that's exactly what I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.75,0:03:23.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure these will continue\Ngrowing into soybeans.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.58,0:03:27.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For now, I'll just sit back and watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.79,0:03:31.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Crops I planted with the almighty\Nfarming tool grow very quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.92,0:03:37.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Actually, sometimes they grow so fast I find\Nmyself thinking "Oh crap!" after they pop up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.67,0:03:40.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,These potatoes, for example, turned green\Nwhere the sun was hitting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.04,0:03:41.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If my memory serves correctly,\Npotato sprouts are poisonous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.83,0:03:42.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm too afraid to try eating these.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.83,0:03:44.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To prevent this from happening again,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.29,0:03:47.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think it's best to put a little mound of soil\Nnear the plant's base.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.75,0:03:51.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I didn't have any idea what I was going on\Nwhen I looked at crops in my previous life,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.08,0:03:56.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I'm sure the farmers had all kinds of\Nknowledge they learned from their experiences.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.25,0:03:59.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My only option now is to press on\Nand learn from my mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.92,0:04:04.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Anyways, the only reason I'm able to\Nlive a life of farming here
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.04,0:04:05.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,is by the grace of the Gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.71,0:04:09.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why I decided to make\Nsome statues of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.04,0:04:10.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just so you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.42,0:04:13.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the one on the left is supposed to be\Nthe God with jurisdiction over agriculture.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.63,0:04:16.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It feels like things are getting\Nmore civilized around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.17,0:04:17.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.33,0:04:22.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm living a very primitive lifestyle here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.17,0:04:25.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Today's lunch is a stew\Nmade from rabbit meat
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.67,0:04:28.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and super fresh farm-to-table vegetables\Ngrown without any pesticides!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.25,0:04:30.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In other words, I just boiled stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.00,0:04:31.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't have anything to season it with.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.96,0:04:33.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mmmm, organic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.96,0:04:36.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Plus the meat from the animals\Nis a lot easier to eat
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.29,0:04:38.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,if I drain the blood as soon as I kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.21,0:04:42.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The dogs like eating the meat from the animals\NI drained the blood from properly, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.46,0:04:45.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I worry that\NI've spoiled them with this food.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.58,0:04:48.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh well. As long as they're enjoying it,\Nthen it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.13,0:04:52.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wish I had some salt, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.25,0:04:55.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I decided to try my hand at something new.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.92,0:04:58.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know it's hard to tell now,\Nbut I planted some fruit bearing trees here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.33,0:05:00.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If this goes well,\Nmy diet will instantly improve, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.46,0:05:01.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Apples!\N{\rSubtitle}If this goes well,{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}my diet will instantly improve, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.71,0:05:02.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If this goes well,\Nmy diet will instantly improve, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.79,0:05:03.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Pears! Pears!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.67,0:05:04.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Pears! Pears!\N{\rSubtitle}they say that fruit trees take years{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}to bear fruit, so I'll need patience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.04,0:05:05.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,they say that fruit trees take years\Nto bear fruit, so I'll need patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.13,0:05:06.58,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Persimmons! Persimmons!\N{\rSubtitle}they say that fruit trees take years{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}to bear fruit, so I'll need patience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.58,0:05:07.54,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Persimmons!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.13,0:05:09.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm prepared to wait as long as I need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.63,0:05:10.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.29,0:05:15.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good boy! Good boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.04,0:05:18.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Life with the dogs is really fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:23.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The loneliness might have been unbearable\Nif I didn't have them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.25,0:05:25.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A horn?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.38,0:05:29.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I am in a different world.\NI guess dogs have horns here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.25,0:05:33.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're all waiting their turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.08,0:05:38.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's another thing that having the dogs\Nhere really helps out with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.54,0:05:42.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They can travel through the forest\Nwithout getting lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.46,0:05:46.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks to that, I can explore\Neven further into the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.92,0:05:48.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And eventually...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.58,0:05:52.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I found a river that could\Nact as a source of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:55.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's a little waterfall upstream\Nthat raises the river up a level.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.54,0:05:58.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think I might be able to dig out a path\Nfor that water to run to my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.13,0:06:02.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a 30-minute walk, so I'd have to do a lot of digging...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.17,0:06:04.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but it'll be fine if I work at it little by little.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.00,0:06:07.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I figured I'd be working away\Nfrom home for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.17,0:06:09.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I built myself a toilet\Nat the construction site.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.04,0:06:11.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup. Nice and civilized.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.29,0:06:19.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I turned the almighty farming tool\Ninto a wheelbarrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.88,0:06:22.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't tire out at all while using\Nthe almighty farming tool,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.75,0:06:27.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so now I can travel around without\Ngetting tired and speed up construction.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.13,0:06:34.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think I need to fix the roads first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.42,0:06:39.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Back at the home base,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.67,0:06:43.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've cleared out more of the forest\Nand continued expanding my crop fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.88,0:06:45.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm growing oilseed rape crops\Nto harvest their oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.92,0:06:47.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's the plant rapeseed oil comes from.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.67,0:06:48.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.67,0:06:52.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's easy to preserve, and I can use it for\Nall kinds of different stuff if I turn it into flour.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.71,0:06:55.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sugarcane, because I want something sweet...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.88,0:06:59.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, those bean sprouts\Ngrew into soybeans before I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.17,0:07:01.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wanted to eat some edamame, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.29,0:07:05.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need salt to make it,\Nand I don't have any.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.67,0:07:08.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder if there's any rock salt around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.50,0:07:11.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Farming Life in Another World.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.96,0:07:17.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How long has it been\Nsince I started living here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.04,0:07:24.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One day, it started to get cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.67,0:07:27.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Honestly, it's too cold\Nto be in these clothes now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.88,0:07:30.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can see snow on the mountains\Nin the distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.13,0:07:32.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder how cold the winters here get.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.83,0:07:36.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need to do something\Nto prepare for the cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.46,0:07:40.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I tried to use the pelt from the giant rabbits,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:42.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but they smelled awful
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.75,0:07:45.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and I was worried that they would\Nstart rotting, so I gave up on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.96,0:07:49.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess my only option is to\Nlight a fire a stay inside my hut.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.00,0:07:52.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll need to gather firewood\Nand food for the winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.88,0:08:00.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A giant black seat cushion?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.50,0:08:02.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that a spider?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.79,0:08:14.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This looks like some really nice cloth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.04,0:08:15.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is it a handkerchief?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.29,0:08:17.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They even embroidered it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.38,0:08:19.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's amazing. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.63,0:08:24.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The spider started living up in the giant tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.58,0:08:26.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And their favorite food is potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.67,0:08:30.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's not just cloth,\Nthey can even make clothes really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.13,0:08:34.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They actually managed to turn the animal pelts\NI'd given up on into some nice stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.79,0:08:37.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can handle the cold with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.42,0:08:41.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bedding stuffed with leaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.75,0:08:43.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Curtains that block the wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.71,0:08:48.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just having stuff made from cloth now\Nhas made this place much more civilized.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.58,0:08:51.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, I gave the spider a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.42,0:08:53.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Based on my first impression,\NI called them Zabuton.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.33,0:08:56.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now I have someone else\NI can count on living here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.13,0:09:01.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Winter finally arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.67,0:09:03.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's gotten pretty cold outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.75,0:09:06.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but thanks to the preparations I made,\NI'll make it through fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.29,0:09:09.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The dogs are all cozy inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.92,0:09:12.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Zabuton might be hibernating or something,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.04,0:09:13.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,because they haven't come down\Nfrom the tree lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.04,0:09:19.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It snows here, but thankfully\Nit doesn't pile up too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.88,0:09:23.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If this region got heavy snow fall,\Nit would have already flattened my hut.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.04,0:09:29.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I am still a little worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.71,0:09:32.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The food stored ahead of time\Nshould be enough to last.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.88,0:09:37.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't have any real problems living here now,\Nbut I do wish I had some salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.92,0:09:42.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For some reason I've been feeling\Nreally lonely lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.63,0:09:45.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's cold...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.67,0:09:50.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How long has it been\Nsince I've talked to someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.29,0:09:54.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At this rate, I might forget how to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.58,0:09:58.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Eventually, the cold started to ease up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.04,0:10:00.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The snow began to melt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.83,0:10:03.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And before long, it felt like spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.25,0:10:10.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Around that time, something was\Nhappening with the puppies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.83,0:10:12.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They all entered the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.88,0:10:15.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was time for them to leave the nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.08,0:10:18.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seeing them grow up so well\Nbrought me some joy, and some sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.96,0:10:23.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As I found myself starting to get lost\Nin those kinds of thoughts...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.00,0:10:24.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is nature...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.83,0:10:28.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They came back a few days later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.08,0:10:30.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Apparently, they had all gone\Nlooking for partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.71,0:10:34.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he got into a fight with a rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.88,0:10:36.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's not easy being a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.63,0:10:39.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And there was one more surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.21,0:10:45.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After not having seen them for a while,\NZabuton showed up with a bunch of kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.63,0:10:48.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess she was a female...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.71,0:10:51.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, this is all good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.92,0:10:55.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Everyone has a bigger family now.\NTo be honest, I'm jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.79,0:11:00.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And so, there were more mouths to feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.83,0:11:03.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That meant it was time to work even harder\Nat expanding my crop fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.29,0:11:09.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.04,0:11:13.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Zabuton's ringing the alarm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.92,0:11:16.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is something nasty heading this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.92,0:11:26.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Kuro led me into the middle of the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.79,0:11:29.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Meeting someone new\Nalways happens as a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.13,0:11:35.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's definitely...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.25,0:11:37.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.71,0:11:39.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why is she in the middle of the forest here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.83,0:11:41.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why is she in this condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.29,0:11:49.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.58,0:11:51.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Help me! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.67,0:11:53.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can understand each other...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.38,0:11:54.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.71,0:11:57.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what's going on here,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.42,0:12:01.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but it's been a long time since I've heard\Nsomeone else's voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.67,0:12:26.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She grew?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.71,0:12:29.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you for saving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.75,0:12:31.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who the heck is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.83,0:12:34.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is she a monster or\Nsomething dangerous like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.58,0:12:43.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait! No! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.79,0:12:46.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Paw! Wait, I mean sit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.17,0:12:51.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She got small again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.54,0:12:56.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So... like, are you... my enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.75,0:12:58.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you here to hurt us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.54,0:13:01.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No! Stop siccing your dogs on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.79,0:13:03.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But you sucked my blood just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.21,0:13:06.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I couldn't help it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.71,0:13:08.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's because of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.13,0:13:11.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come on, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.63,0:13:16.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, she seems harmless enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.38,0:13:21.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,According to her, us meeting\Nwas a complete coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.58,0:13:24.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And the reason she sucked my blood\Nwas to recover her strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.75,0:13:26.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She said that she used too much energy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.58,0:13:29.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and couldn't maintain her body form\Nor her clothes anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.96,0:13:33.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why did they all even attack her\Nin the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.29,0:13:37.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I thought I could take on one of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.54,0:13:40.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay then. So she was the one\Nwho attacked first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.13,0:13:44.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That said, I felt bad at how hard\Nthey'd beaten her up,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.88,0:13:48.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I offered to let her suck some more\Nof my blood so that she could recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.42,0:13:54.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It feels like she's sucking a lot of my blood...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.58,0:13:56.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I don't feel any effects from it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.83,0:13:59.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is this another one of the perks\Nof a healthy body?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.96,0:14:08.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've never tasted blood so full of vitality!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.83,0:14:11.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You must be living a healthy life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.33,0:14:13.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.50,0:14:16.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aren't you smaller than last time?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.58,0:14:19.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? But if I suck any more of your blood,\Nyour life will be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.88,0:14:22.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.\NTake as much as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.33,0:14:23.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,O-okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.46,0:14:31.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't believe there's a place like this\Nin the middle of this forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.17,0:14:34.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are all of these crops yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.04,0:14:38.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've never seen this plant before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.88,0:14:41.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.38,0:14:43.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The one here with the red fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.25,0:14:44.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're very pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.88,0:14:46.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are they decorative plants?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.50,0:14:49.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're tomatoes.\NHave you never seen them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.04,0:14:50.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, this is the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.75,0:14:53.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see. I guess they aren't normal here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.46,0:14:59.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's see. Which one looks good?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.08,0:15:03.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here. Want to try one?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.00,0:15:05.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can eat them just like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.08,0:15:14.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The texture is strange, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.88,0:15:17.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it tastes wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.33,0:15:18.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's so juicy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.75,0:15:22.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It really is nice to hear\Nsomeone praise your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.33,0:15:27.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, I want to see your other crops.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.17,0:15:28.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.29,0:16:00.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I never imagined that I'd ever\Nbe able to learn about
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.58,0:16:03.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so many new species in a single day!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.04,0:16:06.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess that thing is magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.58,0:16:08.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Makes sense. I'm in a different world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.88,0:16:11.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Her name is Lu Lulucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.38,0:16:13.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.25,0:16:17.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, she already sucked a lot of my blood\Nso I shouldn't really be surprised now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.42,0:16:21.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She said that she's doing\Nresearch on medicinal plants.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.13,0:16:23.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And the reason she came to this forest was...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.25,0:16:25.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I got into a little fight with some nobles.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.50,0:16:28.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They were trying to steal\Nmy research away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.63,0:16:32.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After I ran away, they sent a real\Npain in the ass to chase me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.92,0:16:37.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I decided it would be best for me to\Nlay low somewhere until things cooled off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.79,0:16:40.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's when I heard about this forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.29,0:16:42.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I thought coming here might\Nhelp along my research as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.71,0:16:44.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but this is more than I imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.46,0:16:47.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder how many days it'll take me\Nto inspect everything here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.92,0:16:49.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's all very intriguing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.54,0:16:54.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I did almost get wiped out earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.33,0:16:57.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This place really does live up to\Nits savage reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.50,0:16:59.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hm? Its reputation?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.25,0:17:03.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You don't know? But you live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.17,0:17:04.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.04,0:17:06.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And you tamed all those beasts...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.75,0:17:10.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not really sure\Nwhat you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.67,0:17:13.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Anyways, about that magic you're using...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.42,0:17:15.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've never seen any techniques\Nused to create stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.92,0:17:17.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that some kind of magic tool?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.08,0:17:20.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A magic tool? Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.50,0:17:23.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh my, what a day it's been!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.67,0:17:28.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've lived a long life, but I guess there are\Nstill a lot of things left for me to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.63,0:17:34.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's right.\NIt's been a day of surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.13,0:17:38.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I met her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.63,0:17:41.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.13,0:17:44.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't know if something like this\Nwill ever happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.46,0:17:47.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you planning on\Ncontinuing to live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.38,0:17:50.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you are, would it be alright if\NI came to visit again some time?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.58,0:17:51.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have a request!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.33,0:17:53.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.21,0:17:56.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If it's alright with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.04,0:17:58.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,would you stay here with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.42,0:17:59.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.25,0:18:04.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well it'd be grateful if I could stay here\Nto work on my research a little longer...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.08,0:18:06.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want you to live here with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.13,0:18:07.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want you here forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.08,0:18:11.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? D-do you mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.08,0:18:12.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.58,0:18:15.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,W-wait. Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.33,0:18:17.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is all so sudden!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.71,0:18:19.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't want to let this chance get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.29,0:18:25.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But, I told you before...\Nthere are people who are after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.25,0:18:26.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.38,0:18:27.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm a vampire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.75,0:18:28.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not a problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.38,0:18:37.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.17,0:18:42.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've never been good at\Ndealing with other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.00,0:18:45.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The reason I came here was so that I could\Nlive on my own, away from people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.63,0:18:49.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But living here alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.92,0:18:52.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't know how many more years\NI can handle that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.42,0:19:00.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.67,0:19:03.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm okay with it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.54,0:19:07.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it's just all so sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.04,0:19:07.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So then...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.92,0:19:08.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.79,0:19:10.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, I'm okay with staying to live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.96,0:19:12.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's not like I have anywhere else to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.63,0:19:13.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.46,0:19:16.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But we really have only just met each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.83,0:19:20.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can get to know each other\Nwhile we're living together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.21,0:19:22.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's just... so sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.29,0:19:28.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was such a sudden proposal...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.25,0:19:30.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Proposal?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.42,0:19:33.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You told me to stay and\Nlive here with you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.04,0:19:33.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.96,0:19:36.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's pretty lonely here, so I thought it\Nwould be nice if you were here with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.83,0:19:40.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When you asked me to be with you forever,\Nthat's what you meant, isn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.88,0:19:43.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're getting embarrassed now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.54,0:19:45.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.42,0:19:47.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay. So I proposed to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.63,0:19:49.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that not what you meant?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.21,0:19:50.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It is what I meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.21,0:19:51.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In fact, it's exactly what I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.71,0:19:52.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I implore you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.46,0:19:55.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stop! Alright already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.33,0:20:04.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Jeez... I told you okay, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.00,0:20:11.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.46,0:20:13.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.54,0:20:17.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I told you, you're moving too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.50,0:20:33.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.50,0:20:37.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.92,0:20:41.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I never thought a simple greeting\Ncould make me so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.67,0:20:44.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why did you get small again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.25,0:20:45.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's for my own protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.92,0:20:48.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You won't think about touching me\Nas long as I look like this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.67,0:20:51.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah... I'll restrain myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.67,0:20:53.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So what are you working on now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.83,0:20:57.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I was thinking of trying to grow\Nsweet potatoes next.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.17,0:20:58.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.25,0:21:00.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're easy to prepare and eat,\Nand they preserve well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.21,0:21:01.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And now we have more people living here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.50,0:21:05.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right, you're the first person\Nto move in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.67,0:21:07.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That makes you the first villager here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.54,0:21:10.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?\NThis is a village?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.29,0:21:13.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, not yet. It's still not at that level.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.17,0:21:18.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You guys were living here first, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.67,0:21:21.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then there's Zabuton and her family.\NAnd she's got a bunch of kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.71,0:21:26.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So Lu, that makes you...\Nabout the 30th villager, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.54,0:21:29.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What kind of title is that?\NDoes it even matter at that point?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.58,0:21:33.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wanted to ask, do you think we can\Ngrow medicinal herbs in this field?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.38,0:21:37.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think we might be able to.\NLet's try it and find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.33,0:21:38.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.08,0:21:40.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll have to find some way\Nto get our hands on the right seeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.71,0:21:43.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nope. We don't actually need any seeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.63,0:21:45.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.54,0:23:25.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah... I remember we talked about
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.58,0:23:28.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Forest of Death on\Nthe other side of the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.92,0:23:30.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.58,0:23:34.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Man, I've been seeing a lot of\Nstrange customers in here lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.46,0:23:37.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't know if you're searching for someone\Nor what, but you should give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.17,0:23:39.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Unless you can sprout wings and fly, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.42,0:23:42.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Very well. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.63,0:23:45.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your kindness.
